rd transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white/60"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="size-[18px] transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-active/agent:scale-90 motion-reduce:transition-none" style="color:transparent" src="/onboarding/tools/cursor-cube-white.svg?dpl=dpl_3vJXMp6ngN7XuBrhCA21QfK6vZAU"/></button><button type="button" aria-label="Copy the setup prompt for Hermes" title="Hermes" class="group/agent inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-brand-card transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" color="currentColor" class="size-[18px] text-white/60" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.00004 17C4.00004 17 9.99999 12.5811 10 11C10 9.41884 4 5 4 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M12 19H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></button></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy the Prompt setup" class="ml-auto inline-flex size-7 sm:ml-1 items-center justify-center rounded-brand-card text-white/45 transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" color="currentColor" class="size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 11V9C7 5.70017 7 4.05025 8.02513 3.02513C9.05025 2 10.7002 2 14 2C17.2998 2 18.9497 2 19.9749 3.02513C21 4.05025 21 5.70017 21 9V11C21 14.2998 21 15.9497 19.9749 16.9749C18.9497 18 17.2998 18 14 18C10.7002 18 9.05025 18 8.02513 16.9749C7 15.9497 7 14.2998 7 11Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M3 6V15C3 18.2998 3 19.9497 4.02513 20.9749C5.05025 22 6.70017 22 10 22H17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></button></div><div class="grid px-5 py-5 font-mono text-[0.8125rem] leading-[1.7] text-white/85 sm:text-[0.875rem]"><div data-state="active" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_29dbr4nuhqlb_-trigger-prompt" id="radix-_R_29dbr4nuhqlb_-content-prompt" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 col-start-1 row-start-1 mt-0 transition-[opacity,filter,visibility] duration-200 ease-out data-[state=inactive]:invisible data-[state=inactive]:opacity-0 data-[state=inactive]:blur-[2px] motion-reduce:transition-none" style="animation-duration:0s"><p><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 0ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">Signup </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 30ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">for </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 60ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">an </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 90ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">account </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 120ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">&amp; </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 150ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">get </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 180ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">API </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 210ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">key </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 240ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">with </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 270ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused" class="text-[#79c0ff] underline decoration-white/20 underline-offset-2">context.dev/auth.md</span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 300ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">, </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 330ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">then </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 360ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">follow </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 390ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused" class="text-[#79c0ff] underline decoration-white/20 underline-offset-2">docs.context.dev/agent-quickstart</span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 420ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused"> </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 450ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">to </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 480ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">integrate </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 510ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">into </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 540ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">the </span><span style="animation:agent-setup-reveal 400ms ease-out 570ms backwards;animation-play-state:paused">codebase</span></p></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_29dbr4nuhqlb_-trigger-mcp" id="radix-_R_29dbr4nuhqlb_-content-mcp" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 col-start-1 row-start-1 mt-0 transition-[opacity,filter,visibility] duration-200 ease-out data-[state=inactive]:invisible data-[state=inactive]:opacity-0 data-[state=inactive]:blur-[2px] motion-reduce:transition-none break-words"><div><span class="block text-white/35"># Claude Code</span><span class="block">claude mcp add --transport http --scope user context <span class="text-[#79c0ff] underline decoration-white/20 underline-offset-2">https://mcp.context.dev/mcp</span></span><span class="block text-white/35"># Any other MCP client: add <span class="text-[#79c0ff] underline decoration-white/20 underline-offset-2">https://mcp.context.dev/mcp</span></span></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_29dbr4nuhqlb_-trigger-cli" id="radix-_R_29dbr4nuhqlb_-content-cli" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 col-start-1 row-start-1 mt-0 transition-[opacity,filter,visibility] duration-200 ease-out data-[state=inactive]:invisible data-[state=inactive]:opacity-0 data-[state=inactive]:blur-[2px] motion-reduce:transition-none break-words"><div><span class="block text-white/35"># Install: <span class="text-[#79c0ff] underline decoration-white/20 underline-offset-2">docs.context.dev/install-cli</span></span><span class="block">export CONTEXT_DEV_API_KEY=your_api_key</span><span class="block">context-dev web web-scrape-md --url https://example.com</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none relative z-[71] mt-10 mb-8 h-px md:mt-12"><div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 h-px w-screen -translate-x-1/2 bg-gray-200"></div><span class="absolute size-2 rounded-full bg-gray-300 top-1/2 left-[calc(-1*var(--marketing-gutter))] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"></span><span class="absolute size-2 rounded-full bg-gray-300 top-1/2 right-[calc(-1*var(--marketing-gutter))] translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"></span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="-m-2 flex rounded-brand-section bg-brand-primary/10 p-2"><article class="group/card relative flex flex-1 flex-col gap-10 overflow-hidden rounded-brand-section bg-white p-6 ring-1 ring-black/[0.08] md:p-8"><div class="relative flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><h3 class="text-h3 font-normal text-black">Search</h3><a class="inline-flex w-fit items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-5 py-3 text-body font-normal transition-colors duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none border-brand-primary bg-white text-brand-primary hover:bg-brand-blue-10 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring focus-visible:ring-0 group/explore shrink-0 gap-1.5" href="/search">Explore<span class="sr-only"> <!-- -->Search</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" color="currentColor" class="size-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/explore:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover/explore:translate-x-0.5 motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 6.65032C9 6.65032 15.9383 6.10759 16.9154 7.08463C17.8924 8.06167 17.3496 15 17.3496 15M16.5 7.5L6.5 17.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></a></div><p class="text-body-lg text-black/65">Search the web or the news and get ranked results with clean page content, not just links.</p><ul aria-label="What you can build with Search" class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><li class="rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-body-sm text-brand-neutral-70 ring-1 ring-inset ring-black/10">Fresh sources for RAG</li><li class="rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-body-sm text-brand-neutral-70 ring-1 ring-inset ring-black/10">Company news</li><li class="rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-body-sm text-brand-neutral-70 ring-1 ring-inset ring-black/10">Agent web search</li></ul></div><div class="relative mt-auto flex flex-1 flex-col rounded-brand-card bg-brand-primary/10 p-2"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-brand-card bg-white"><div class="relative flex flex-1 flex-col">