clamp-3">Mastra built an onboarding MVP in an hour with Context.dev, pre-filling names and company details and tailoring the experience to each user&#x27;s goals.</p><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-5 py-3 text-body font-normal transition-colors duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none border-white text-white hover:bg-white/12 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring focus-visible:ring-0 mt-auto group-hover:bg-white/12">Read their story</span></div></article></a></div><div data-slide="true" class="homepage-card-carousel__slide relative z-30 hover:z-40 shrink-0 snap-center snap-always"><a class="group rounded-brand-section focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-black" href="/blog/tinfoil-switches-to-context-dev-for-zero-data-retention-web-scraping"><article class="relative flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-brand-section bg-brand-primary sm:h-[31.25rem]"><div class="relative flex h-60 shrink-0 items-center justify-center sm:h-49"><div class="absolute inset-0 size-full" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 760 540" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" class="block size-full opacity-0"></svg><canvas class="absolute inset-0 size-full invisible"></canvas></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-8 max-sm:p-6"><time class="mb-1.5 block text-body-sm text-white" dateTime="2026-09-11">Sep 11, 2026</time><h3 class="mb-3 text-h4 font-normal text-white">Tinfoil</h3><p class="mb-8 line-clamp-4 text-body-lg text-white max-sm:mb-6 max-sm:line-clamp-3">Tinfoil added Context.dev scraping and metadata to its web search agent in under five minutes.</p><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-5 py-3 text-body font-normal transition-colors duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none border-white text-white hover:bg-white/12 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring focus-visible:ring-0 mt-auto group-hover:bg-white/12">Read their story</span></div></article></a></div><div data-slide="true" class="homepage-card-carousel__slide relative z-30 hover:z-40 shrink-0 snap-center snap-always"><a class="group rounded-brand-section focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-black" href="/blog/squad-gives-its-ai-agents-web-access-in-5-minutes-with-context-dev"><article class="relative flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-brand-section bg-brand-primary sm:h-[31.25rem]"><div class="relative flex h-60 shrink-0 items-center justify-center sm:h-49"><div class="absolute inset-0 size-full" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 760 540" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" class="block size-full opacity-0"></svg><canvas class="absolute inset-0 size-full invisible"></canvas></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-8 max-sm:p-6"><time class="mb-1.5 block text-body-sm text-white" dateTime="2026-09-09">Sep 9, 2026</time><h3 class="mb-3 text-h4 font-normal text-white">Squad</h3><p class="mb-8 line-clamp-4 text-body-lg text-white max-sm:mb-6 max-sm:line-clamp-3">Squad integrated Context.dev in five minutes to give its AI agents webpage scraping, screenshots, and structured data extraction, building on Bhanu&#x27;s experience using the API at SiteGPT.</p><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-5 py-3 text-body font-normal transition-colors duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none border-white text-white hover:bg-white/12 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring focus-visible:ring-0 mt-auto group-hover:bg-white/12">Read their story</span></div></article></a></div><div data-slide="true" cl