sk:url(/blog-covers/trends-halo.svg) center / contain no-repeat"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;mask:url(/blog-covers/trends.svg) center / contain no-repeat;-webkit-mask:url(/blog-covers/trends.svg) center / contain no-repeat"></div></div><canvas class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full invisible"></canvas></div></div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col p-8 pt-6"><time class="text-body-sm text-white/70" dateTime="2026-09-28">Sep 28, 2026</time><h3 class="mt-2 text-h4 font-normal line-clamp-2 text-white" title="Introducing Context Highlights">Introducing Context Highlights</h3><p class="mt-3 text-body line-clamp-2 text-white/80">Token-efficient web extraction for agents. Context Highlights returns the relevant passages from a webpage for your query.</p></div></article></a><a class="group brand-glass-ring block bg-transparent transition-colors duration-300 ease-out hover:bg-white/30 focus-visible:outline-none motion-reduce:transition-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#1a1a1a]" href="/blog/introducing-answers-api"><article class="relative flex h-[26rem] flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-brand-section sm:h-[31.25rem]" style="background-color:#FFFFFF"><div class="relative min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-full w-full"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><svg class="absolute inset-0 size-full"><path d="" fill="none" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-opacity="0.14" stroke-width="1"></path></svg></div><div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/introducing-answers-api-halo.svg) center / contain no-repeat;-webkit-mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/introducing-answers-api-halo.svg) center / contain no-repeat"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-color:#2563EB;mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/introducing-answers-api.svg) center / contain no-repeat;-webkit-mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/introducing-answers-api.svg) center / contain no-repeat"></div></div><canvas class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full invisible"></canvas></div></div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col p-8 pt-6"><time class="text-body-sm text-black/55" dateTime="2026-09-16">Sep 16, 2026</time><h3 class="mt-2 text-h4 font-normal line-clamp-2 text-black" title="Introducing the Answers API">Introducing the Answers API</h3><p class="mt-3 text-body line-clamp-2 text-black/70">Give Answers a research task and get structured JSON with source URLs. Web research for your app or agent, in one API call.</p></div></article></a><a class="group brand-glass-ring block bg-transparent transition-colors duration-300 ease-out hover:bg-white/30 focus-visible:outline-none motion-reduce:transition-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#1a1a1a]" href="/blog/file-type-npm-stateful-race-condition-parallel-image-detection"><article class="relative flex h-[26rem] flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-brand-section sm:h-[31.25rem]" style="background-color:#2563EB"><div class="relative min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-full w-full"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><svg class="absolute inset-0 size-full"><path d="" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-opacity="0.22" stroke-width="1"></path></svg></div><div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-color:#2563EB;mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/file-type-npm-stateful-race-condition-parallel-image-detection-halo.svg) center / contain no-repeat;-webkit-mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/file-type-npm-stateful-race-condition-parallel-image-detection-halo.svg) center / contain no-repeat"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/file-type-npm-stateful-race-condition-parallel-image-detection.svg) center / contain no-repeat;-webkit-mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/file-type-npm-stateful-race-condition-parallel-image-detection.svg) center / contain no-repeat"></div></div><canvas class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full invisible"></canvas></div></div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col p-8 pt-6"><time class="text-body-sm text-white/70" dateTime="2026-05-04">May 4, 2026</time><h3 class="mt-2 text-h4 font-normal line-clamp-2 text-white" title="The Hidden Race Condition in file-type That Corrupted Our Parallel Image Detection">The Hidden Race Condition in file-type That Corrupted Our Parallel Image Detection</h3><p class="mt-3 text-body line-clamp-2 text-white/80">Our logo candidate list kept shrinking at random. We traced it to the file-type npm package, which shares internal state across detections and returns mismatched MIME types when called in parallel.</p></div></article></a><a class="group brand-glass-ring block bg-transparent transition-colors duration-300 ease-out hover:bg-white/30 focus-visible:outline-none motion-reduce:transition-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#1a1a1a]" href="/blog/redos-regex-denial-of-service"><article class="relative flex h-[26rem] flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-brand-section sm:h-[31.25rem]" style="background-color:#FFFFFF"><div class="relative min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-full w-full"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><svg class="absolute inset-0 size-full"><path d="" fill="none" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-opacity="0.14" stroke-width="1"></path></svg></div><div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/redos-regex-denial-of-service-halo.svg) center / contain no-repeat;-webkit-mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/redos-regex-denial-of-service-halo.svg) center / contain no-repeat"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-color:#2563EB;mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/redos-regex-denial-of-service.svg) center / contain no-repeat;-webkit-mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/redos-regex-denial-of-service.svg) center / contain no-repeat"></div></div><canvas class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full invisible"></canvas></div></div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col p-8 pt-6"><time class="text-body-sm text-black/55" dateTime="2025-09-21">Sep 21, 2025</time><h3 class="mt-2 text-h4 font-normal line-clamp-2 text-black" title="How We Fixed a ReDoS Vulnerability That Turned 15-Second Requests into 5-Minute Timeouts at Context.dev">How We Fixed a ReDoS Vulnerability That Turned 15-Second Requests into 5-Minute Timeouts at Context.dev</h3><p class="mt-3 text-body line-clamp-2 text-black/70">Learn how we discovered and fixed a ReDoS (Regular Expression Denial of Service) vulnerability that was causing our HTML parsing to timeout.</p></div></article></a><a class="group brand-glass-ring block bg-transparent transition-colors duration-300 ease-out hover:bg-white/30 focus-visible:outline-none motion-reduce:transition-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#1a1a1a]" href="/blog/preventing-memory-issues-in-node-js-sharp-a-journey"><article class="relative flex h-[26rem] flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-brand-section sm:h-[31.25rem]" style="background-color:#2563EB"><div class="relative min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div aria-hidden="true" class="relative h-full w-full"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><svg class="absolute inset-0 size-full"><path d="" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-opacity="0.22" stroke-width="1"></path></svg></div><div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-color:#2563EB;mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/preventing-memory-issues-in-node-js-sharp-a-journey-halo.svg) center / contain no-repeat;-webkit-mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/preventing-memory-issues-in-node-js-sharp-a-journey-halo.svg) center / contain no-repeat"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/preventing-memory-issues-in-node-js-sharp-a-journey.svg) center / contain no-repeat;-webkit-mask:url(/blog-covers/posts/preventing-memory-issues-in-node-js-sharp-a-journey.svg) center / contain no-repeat"></div></div><canvas class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full invisible"></canvas></div></div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col p-8 pt-6"><time class="text-body-sm text-white/70" dateTime="2025-07-19">Jul 19, 2025</time><h3 class="mt-2 text-h4 font-normal line-clamp-2 text-white" title="Preventing Memory Issues in Node.js Sharp: A Journey">Preventing Memory Issues in Node.js Sharp: A Journey</h3><p class="mt-3 text-body line-clamp-2 text-white/80">Learn how to prevent memory issues when using Sharp in Node.js. Practical tips and techniques for handling image processing at scale.</p></div></article></a></div></div></div></section></div><div class="contents max-md:[&amp;&gt;*]:[content-visibility:auto] max-md:[&amp;&gt;*]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_900px]"><section id="faq" class="relative pt-16 pb-10 md:pt-20 md:pb-12"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-[70] flex justify-center top-0"><div class="relative h-full w-full max-w-[100vw] md:max-w-[90vw] lg:max-w-[85vw] xl:max-w-[var(--marketing-inner-max,68.75rem)]"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-gray-200"></div><div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-px translate-x-1/2 bg-gray-200"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 h-px w-screen -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-gray-200"></div><span class="absolute size-2 rounded-full bg-gray-300 top-0 left-0 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"></span><span class="absolute size-2 rounded-full bg-gray-300 top-0